        "id": "OlafAxeThrowCast",
        "name": "Undertow",
        "description": "Olaf throws an axe into the ground at a target location, dealing damage to enemies it passes through and reducing their Armor and Move Speed. If Olaf picks up the axe, the ability's cooldown is reset.",
        "tooltip": "Olaf throws an axe, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(70/120/170/220/270 + (100% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 30/35/40/45/50% for up to 3 seconds (based on distance travelled). Champions hit lose <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">20% Armor</span> for 4 seconds.<br /><br />If Olaf picks up the axe, this Ability's Cooldown is reduced to 2.5 seconds, or fully refunded if 2.5 seconds has elapsed.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 20/45/70/95/120 bonus damage to monsters.</span>",
